|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | #25 / `DES-M5-WAVE1-TRACE-002` | `packages/analysis/src/trace.ts` — `loadTrace(root)` missing-cache error | `Trace graph missing; run musubix3 trace build.` | `Trace graph missing; run musubix5 trace build.` |
| 2 | #11 / `REQ-M5-WAVE1-NAMING-001` | `packages/analysis/src/model-correspondence.ts` — `validateModelCorrespondenceEvidence(root)` missing-evidence diagnostic | `Run \`npx musubix3 evidence refresh\` to generate .musubix/evidence/model-correspondence.json.` | `Run \`npx musubix5 evidence refresh\` to generate .musubix/evidence/model-correspondence.json.` |
| 3 | #11 / `REQ-M5-WAVE1-NAMING-001` | `packages/cli/src/install.ts` — `install(root, packageRoot, options)` initial `.musubix/evidence/quality.json` reason | `No checks have run. Configure commands and run musubix3 gate.` | `No checks have run. Configure commands and run musubix5 gate.` |
| 4 | #11 / `REQ-M5-WAVE1-NAMING-001` | `packages/cli/src/install.ts` — `install(root, packageRoot, options)` generated `.gitignore` comment | `# musubix3 generated caches` | `# musubix5 generated caches` |
